WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
Welcome to our training on preparing for the holiday season with ads and coupons.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:11.240
We'll cover some strategies for using ads and coupons to help you have a successful holiday season.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.320
Let's start with coupons.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:19.979
Coupons are easy to use marketing tools that let you offer discounts on a single product or a set

00:00:19.979 --> 00:00:20.680
of products.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:27.400
Customers can discover coupons in search results, product detail pages, the offer listings page,

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.800
and in their shopping carts.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:36.025
Coupons and their associated badging can help increase the visibility of your products in search

00:00:36.025 --> 00:00:36.440
results.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:44.547
The most popular coupons are also merchandised on the coupon's home page, category pages, and shopping

00:00:44.547 --> 00:00:45.560
event pages.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:52.293
During holiday seasons or shopping events, the Amazon Store experiences increased traffic, especially

00:00:52.293 --> 00:00:55.400
to pages offering discounts and deals.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.960
This extra visibility can help drive sales for your products.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:04.920
Customers engage with coupons by clipping them to apply a discount.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:09.040
This can lead to more interaction with your brand or products.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.640
Coupons are also 100% self-service.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:16.480
You can create them in Seller Central at any time.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:22.625
You can also set the date that customers can start using your coupons for as early as the day you

00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:23.240
create them.

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:27.480
There are ways to control your coupons to meet your specific goals.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:32.360
For example, you can select the ASINs that coupons will appear on.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:36.320
New ASINs and ASINs without reviews are eligible.

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:40.120
Coupons also last longer than other deal types.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:47.131
You can create them to last up to 90 days to provide discounts to customers throughout the holiday

00:01:47.131 --> 00:01:47.520
season.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:52.840
You can set coupons to reach specific customer segments like Amazon Prime members.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:59.640
This can help you refine your overall strategy both during holiday seasons and business as usual.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:06.280
Let's review some best practices for maximizing success using coupons during the holidays.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:10.040
First, you can run coupons on your new ASINs.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:17.160
New ASINs usually need to build up a sales history before they're eligible for deals or other promotions.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:22.600
Running a coupon on these new ASINs can increase visibility in the short term

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:29.480
by driving sales and in the long term by driving reviews and establishing a sales history.

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:34.600
You can help products with a low conversion rate improve by running a coupon.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:42.200
An attractive discount can help turn customer glance views also known as impressions into sales.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:45.880
This is especially true during holiday seasons.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:51.240
Coupons can be created for either a percentage off or money off discount.

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:56.920
Regardless of which you choose, coupons require a minimum discount of 5%

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:00.520
and cannot exceed a 50% discount.

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:05.640
It's important to consider whether your budget can cover the cost of customer demand

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:10.200
that your coupon will generate especially during the holidays.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:15.480
Let's say you set your coupon with a deep discount of over 40%.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:20.040
Deep discounts have a higher chance of showing up on the coupon's home page

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:23.640
and can potentially drive increased sales during the holidays.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.480
You'll want to set a budget that won't run out too quickly

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:32.680
as it might limit the number of customers who could take advantage of your deep discount coupon.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:37.480
You can also try using a money off discount for higher priced products.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:43.240
Customers might respond more positively when they know exactly how much they're saving

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.480
without having to calculate it themselves.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:51.400
Finally, create coupons for before and after a holiday season event.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.240
This can help you benefit from increased holiday traffic.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:00.760
Sponsored products ads can help increase product visibility and sales

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:04.200
even during the increased traffic of the holiday season.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:09.480
A sponsored products campaign lets you bid on specific keywords.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.920
When a shopper searches for one of these keywords,

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:16.520
your ads can display on the first page of the search results.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:22.040
Ads are automatically selected to appear based on their overall relevance,

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.040
their bid and other factors.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:28.040
These ads are pay-per-click or PPC,

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.480
which means you're only charged when a shopper clicks your ad

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:33.400
and visits the product detail page.

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:37.080
If you haven't run a sponsored products campaign before,

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:40.840
you can earn free promotional clicks when you register.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:46.680
The amount you receive toward clicks will vary depending on the country you're located in.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:49.720
To run a sponsored products campaign,

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:55.000
you'll need an active professional selling account in good standing in the Amazon store.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:59.800
You'll also need to be able to ship to the country you're advertising for

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.720
and have a valid payment method.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:07.560
The listings that you want to advertise should also be eligible for the featured offer

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:09.960
in one or more available categories.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:15.160
It helps to create sponsored products campaigns with a strategy in mind.

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:19.400
You can start by choosing either a keyword or product campaign.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:26.200
Keyword campaigns let you select relevant keywords shoppers might search for to find your products.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:31.320
Product campaigns let you choose complementary product detail pages

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:35.720
that shoppers might visit to purchase your products or related products.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:42.360
If you choose to run a keyword campaign, you can then decide to run it either automatically or manually.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:47.000
An automatic keyword campaign can be a great way to start.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:53.160
It's fast, easy, and can help you quickly identify relevant, high-performing keywords

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:57.800
which in turn can help you understand how customers are finding your products.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:03.160
Manual keyword campaigns give you more control over your strategy,

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:06.840
allowing you to focus more heavily on high-performing keywords.

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:10.280
If you're new to sponsored products campaigns,

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:14.120
we recommend first running an automatic keyword campaign

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:18.040
rather than a manual one during holiday seasons and key events.

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:23.240
To get started, you'll just need to know which products you'd like to advertise,

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:27.560
how much you can spend on daily budget, which keywords you want to add,

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.400
and how much you want to bid on each keyword.

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:33.960
You can also boost the discoverability of your

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:37.096
coupon ASINs with a Sponsored products campaign.

00:06:37.096 --> 00:06:40.680
When you create a Sponsored products campaign for

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:46.440
your coupons, customers can find them on the first page of search results and product pages.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:53.000
The coupon's badge will appear in these ads, giving customers another reason to click.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:59.080
Combining coupon discounts with sponsored products can help customers more easily find

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:02.280
your products and help increase your sales.

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:05.480
If your products fit holiday shopping trends,

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:10.440
you can market your products more effectively by focusing on popular search terms.

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:16.600
Remember to combine the strategies we've covered to help you have a successful holiday season.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:21.160
This concludes the training on advertising and coupons for the holiday season.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:24.320
Thank you, and happy selling in the Amazon store.
